+# Deliberately BROKEN competency query.
+#
+# It uses the prefix `dfo:` without declaring it, which is the exact defect
+# the shipped competency file carried until 2026-09-10 (three queries in one
+# .rq, and at one point an undeclared prefix). scripts/validation-selftest.sh
+# runs scripts/run-competency-questions.sh over this directory and asserts
+# that the runner exits non-zero. A runner that executed this "successfully"
+# would be reporting a parse error as a pass.
+#
+# Do not fix this query. Retires when: the competency runner is deleted, or a
+# different mechanism proves it fails on an unparseable query.
+
+PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
+
+SELECT ?statusZone ?label WHERE {
+  ?statusZone a dfo:StockStatusZone ;
+              rdfs:label ?label .
+}
